  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA Bridge Funding for Family Planning Commodities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to increased availability of quality affordable family planning commodities, which is a critical condition for access to modern methods of family planning. It will achieve this by easing the cash constraints facing UNFPA Supplies and allowing them to procure on behalf of countries more quickly and efficiently. This will reduce delays and stockouts for countries, increase value for money for donors like DFID and support countries in transitioning to paying a greater share of their contraceptive bills from their own budgets.</narrative>
  </description>
